--- !u!114 &1686971437
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1686971428}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f25f07dad1b883d4498e5fb9330dcf5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Convergence.Presentation::Convergence.Presentation.Ride.WinCelebrationView
  director: {fileID: 1686971435}
  pixel: {fileID: 603429048}
  cardGames:
  - {fileID: 1697314086}
  - {fileID: 584838143}
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 1936187888}
  - {fileID: 356430545}
  titles:
  - 1  PIXELS
  - 2  NEURON
  - 3  NETWORK
  - 4  BACKPROP
  - 5  TRAINING
  ideas:
  - A picture is just numbers.
  - A neuron is a tiny judge.
  - Many judges, working together.
  - Send the blame backwards.
  - Walk downhill on the loss.
  facts:
  - '- A pixel is one tiny square of the picture.

    - Blank is 0, full ink is 1.

    - Your 3 became 49 numbers (7 x 7).

    - Those numbers are all the network ever sees.'
  - '- Every pixel gets a weight: how much it matters.

    - Green: ink here says 3.  Red: ink here says not a 3.

    - Multiply, add it all up, squish it to 0..1.

    - Close to 1 means "Yes, I see it!"'
  - '- 16 hidden neurons each look for a different piece.

    - 10 answer neurons, one for each digit.

    - 944 weights, all random at the start.

    - The brightest answer is the network''s guess.'
  - '- We know the right answer: the digit is labelled 3.

    - The loss scores how wrong the guess was.

    - Backprop works out how much each wire is to blame.

    - That is its gradient: which way to nudge, and how much.'
  - '- Step against the gradient: gradient descent.

    - Step size = learning rate. Too big jumps, too small crawls.

    - Guess, loss, backprop, step... thousands of times.

    - Tested on 500 digits it never saw: 85 in 100 right.'
  colors:
  - {r: 0.37, g: 0.91, b: 1, a: 1}
  - {r: 1, g: 0.71, b: 0.28, a: 1}
  - {r: 0.43, g: 0.71, b: 1, a: 1}
  - {r: 0.88, g: 0.44, b: 1, a: 1}
  - {r: 1, g: 0.82, b: 0.4, a: 1}
  bigCard: {fileID: 1129389382}
  header: {fileID: 262910251}
  title: {fileID: 1400651200}
  idea: {fileID: 425065034}
  body: {fileID: 1123113526}
  border: {fileID: 1911705354}
  slots:
  - {fileID: 219737965}
  - {fileID: 453181029}
  - {fileID: 1610821066}
  - {fileID: 751210179}
  - {fileID: 190913696}
  slotFaces:
  - {fileID: 1417507583}
  - {fileID: 1318271300}
  - {fileID: 930852725}
  - {fileID: 520371523}
  - {fileID: 1721041445}
